{"alias":"/innovation/rrev/research","title":"RREV Research & Support","changed":"2026-04-06T23:15:20+00:00","before":"<p><img alt=\"RREV Research &amp; Support Web Banner\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"9df8b6bf-4a59-484c-a7ab-a207061d95fc\" height=\"100%\" src=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-images/RREV%20-%20Research%20%26%20Support.png\" width=\"100%\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>The <a href=\"http://region1cc.org/\" target=\"_blank\">Region 1 Comprehensive Center</a> (Comp Center) has been involved with the RREV project before it was an officially awarded project! Working with the Maine DOE team that wrote the grant to the Federal Government, the Comp Center helped provide needed background research, important literature reviews, and the proposed format for developing a pilot idea.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>After the grant was selected, the Comp Center team continued to support the RREV project in many ways. They met with the RREV team on a bi-weekly basis throughout the entirety of the RREV project. During these bi-weekly meetings, they served as thought partners and help develop many additional tools and resources that would guide and support the RREV work. One of the largest group of resources they produced for the RREV project was a video module series and set of companion guides that would serve as an asynchronous \"course\" for developing a pilot. Every school team wishing to submit their pilot idea for RREV funding had to complete an Innovative Mindset &amp; Pilot Development (IMPD) course. This module series was our online version for schools to access.</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\">\r\n<div class=\"card\"><img alt=\"RREV Van\" class=\"card-img-top\" height=\"100%\" src=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-images/RREV%20RD%20-%20Research%20-%20Comp%20Center.png\" width=\"100%\" />\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<h5 class=\"card-title\">Comp Center Tools &amp; Resources</h5>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n\t<li>Literature Reviews\r\n\t<ol>\r\n\t\t<li><a data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"50367230-ee3c-4f24-a984-00afe4b1e2dd\" filename=\"RREV - Design Thinking Lit Review - 9.03.2024.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/RREV%20-%20Design%20Thinking%20Lit%20Review%20-%209.03.2024.pdf\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Design Thinking Lit Review\">Design Thinking</a></li>\r\n\t\t<li><a data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"c346e41f-e81e-42e1-b39d-51e602c51829\" filename=\"RREV - Extended Learning Opportunities - 9.03.2024.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/RREV%20-%20Extended%20Learning%20Opportunities%20-%209.03.2024.pdf\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"ELO Lit Review\">Extended Learning Opportunities</a></li>\r\n\t\t<li><a data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"a13fa44c-10f7-49b8-be4e-d80d5d2550a3\" filename=\"RREV - Multiple Pathways - 9.03.2024.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/RREV%20-%20Multiple%20Pathways%20-%209.03.2024.pdf\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Multiple Pathways Lit Review\">Multiple Pathways</a></li>\r\n\t\t<li><a data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"1d51fe00-b2a9-463b-8d28-4439f0b25e1e\" filename=\"RREV - Continuous Improvement Lit Review - 9.03.2024.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/RREV%20-%20Continuous%20Improvement%20Lit%20Review%20-%209.03.2024.pdf\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Continuous Improvement Lit Review\">Continuous Improvement</a></li>\r\n\t</ol>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li><a href=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/RREV%20-%20Pilot%20Model%20Template%20-%209.17.2024.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">IMPD Pilot Template</a></li>\r\n\t<li><a data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"29868931-3fc2-42d0-aef5-378902457052\" filename=\"RREV - Logic Model R1CC RREV Template - 9.03.2024.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/RREV%20-%20Logic%20Model%20R1CC%20RREV%20Template%20-%209.03.2024.pdf\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Logic Model Template\">Logic Model Template</a></li>\r\n\t<li><a href=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/RREV%20-%20Coaching%20Framework%20-%209.17.2024.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Coaching Framework</a></li>\r\n\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"a215413b-8e57-41fe-8478-f728da5f7363\" filename=\"RREV - Innovation Coaches Journey Map - 9.27.2024.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/RREV%20-%20Innovation%20Coaches%20Journey%20Map%20-%209.27.2024.pdf\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"RREV Coaches Journey Map\">Coaches Journey Map</a></li>\r\n\t<li><a data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"8e4ca963-ed04-41aa-b382-a113f485e2bb\" filename=\"RREV - Culture of Innovation - 9.03.2024.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/RREV%20-%20Culture%20of%20Innovation%20-%209.03.2024.pdf\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Culture of Innovation\">Culture of Innovation</a></li>\r\n\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"9639d5e5-1506-4117-8b6b-45f5497d365c\" filename=\"RREV - Scaling Innovation-Self Reflection - 9.27.2024.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/RREV%20-%20Scaling%20Innovation-Self%20Reflection%20-%209.27.2024.pdf\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"RREV Sustainability Self-Reflection\">Sustainability Self-Reflection</a></li>\r\n\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"fab909c4-a45b-4f44-88e9-a743e278e343\" filename=\"RREV - Creating Conditions to Support Innovation - 9.27.2024.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/RREV%20-%20Creating%20Conditions%20to%20Support%20Innovation%20-%209.27.2024.pdf\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"RREV Creating Conditions to Support Innovation\">Creating Conditions to Support Innovation</a></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\">\r\n<div class=\"card\"><img alt=\"Card image cap\" class=\"card-img-top\" src=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-images/RREV%20RD%20-%20Research%20-%20Modules.png\" width=\"100%\" />\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<h5 class=\"card-title\">Comp Center IMPD Module Series</h5>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n\t<li>Module 1 Video - <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CPRsjztwld8&amp;list=PL-cO8lcaOYu3LpJBpBbOPpX64LBvO1F7t&amp;index=40\" target=\"_blank\">Introduction to the Module Series</a></li>\r\n\t<li>Module 2 Video - <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=S0qWs1PoyTI&amp;list=PL-cO8lcaOYu3LpJBpBbOPpX64LBvO1F7t&amp;index=41&amp;t=1s\" target=\"_blank\">Using Data to Define the Need</a></li>\r\n\t<li>Module 2 <a data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"143229f6-7a64-4cd8-8ea9-b30e2c3cee69\" filename=\"RREV - Companion Guide Mod 2 - 9.03.2024.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/RREV%20-%20Companion%20Guide%20Mod%202%20-%209.03.2024.pdf\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"RREV - Companion Guide Mod 2\">Companion Guide</a></li>\r\n\t<li>Module 3 Video - <a href=\"https://engine.maine.gov/sites/default/files/resourced/Module%203-Planning%20for%20Innovation.mp4\" target=\"_top\">Planning for an Innovation</a></li>\r\n\t<li>Module 3 <a data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"8020cdb0-e842-4555-a5f3-ce0ef057ae61\" filename=\"RREV - Companion Guide Mod 3 - 9.03.2024.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/RREV%20-%20Companion%20Guide%20Mod%203%20-%209.03.2024.pdf\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"RREV - Companion Guide Mod 3\">Companion Guide</a></li>\r\n\t<li>Module 4 Video - <a href=\"https://engine.maine.gov/sites/default/files/resourced/Module%204-Defining%20Outcomes.mp4\" target=\"_blank\">Defining Outcomes &amp; Identifying Measures</a></li>\r\n\t<li>Module 4 <a data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"8a84b549-31e1-4e8c-8f82-b3731373cc2c\" filename=\"RREV - Companion Guide Mod 4 - 9.03.2024.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/RREV%20-%20Companion%20Guide%20Mod%204%20-%209.03.2024.pdf\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"RREV - Companion Guide Mod 4\">Companion Guide</a></li>\r\n\t<li>Module 5 Video - <a href=\"https://engine.maine.gov/sites/default/files/resourced/Module%205-Innovation%20Expenditures_0.mp4\" target=\"_blank\">Preparing for Innovation Expenditures</a></li>\r\n\t<li>Module 5 <a data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"7907e254-7e91-4948-8c21-bced4d844fca\" filename=\"RREV - Companion Guide Mod 5 - 9.03.2024.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/RREV%20-%20Companion%20Guide%20Mod%205%20-%209.03.2024.pdf\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"RREV - Companion Guide Mod 5\">Companion Guide</a></li>\r\n\t<li>Module 6 Video - <a href=\"https://engine.maine.gov/sites/default/files/resourced/Module%206-Communicating%20with%20Stakeholders_0.mp4\" target=\"_blank\">Communicating with Stakeholders</a></li>\r\n\t<li>Module 6 <a data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"2226a1b5-191f-410c-a40c-4a5724c7ad9a\" filename=\"RREV - Companion Guide Mod 6 - 9.03.2024.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/RREV%20-%20Companion%20Guide%20Mod%206%20-%209.03.2024.pdf\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"RREV - Companion Guide Mod 6\">Companion Guide</a></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p>As part of the open licensing requirement with the Federally awarded RREV Grant, all materials developed by/for RREV are open to the public to use, reuse, modify and share using the CC BY-NC-SA license. Please use this icon when sharing</p>\r\n<img alt=\"RREV Van\" class=\"card-img-top\" height=\"50%\" src=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-images/RREV%20-%20Creative%20Commons%20Logo.png\" width=\"50%\" /></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"contact-cube\">\r\n<h3><strong>Contact</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Elaine Bartley</strong><br />\r\n<em>RREV R&amp;D Project Director</em><br />\r\n<strong>Phone</strong>: 207-816-0268<br />\r\n<strong>Email</strong>: <a href=\"mailto:Elaine.Bartley@maine.gov\">Elaine.Bartley@maine.gov</a></p>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n<p><strong>Page Nichols</strong><br />\r\n<em>Chief Innovation Officer</em><br />\r\n<strong>Phone</strong>: 207-624-6692<br />\r\n<strong>Email</strong>: <a href=\"mailto:Page.Nicholas@maine.gov\">Page.Nicholas@maine.gov</a></p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n","after":"<div class=\"doe-hero\">\n<p class=\"doe-contact-link\"><a href=\"#contact\">Contact</a></p>\n<p class=\"doe-lead\">The <a href=\"http://region1cc.org/\" target=\"_blank\">Region 1 Comprehensive Center</a> (Comp Center) has been involved with the RREV project before it was an officially awarded project! Working with the Maine DOE team that wrote the grant to the Federal Government, the Comp Center helped provide needed background research, important literature reviews, and the proposed format for developing a pilot idea.</p>\n\n</div>\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>After the grant was selected, the Comp Center team continued to support the RREV project in many ways. They met with the RREV team on a bi-weekly basis throughout the entirety of the RREV project. During these bi-weekly meetings, they served as thought partners and help develop many additional tools and resources that would guide and support the RREV work. One of the largest group of resources they produced for the RREV project was a video module series and set of companion guides that would serve as an asynchronous \"course\" for developing a pilot. Every school team wishing to submit their pilot idea for RREV funding had to complete an Innovative Mindset &amp; Pilot Development (IMPD) course. This module series was our online version for schools to access.</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\r\n<div class=\"card\"><img alt=\"RREV Van\" class=\"card-img-top\" height=\"100%\" src=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-images/RREV%20RD%20-%20Research%20-%20Comp%20Center.png\" width=\"100%\" />\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<h3 class=\"card-title\">Comp Center Tools &amp; Resources</h3>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action\">Literature Reviews\r\n\t<ol>\r\n\t\t<li><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/RREV%20-%20Design%20Thinking%20Lit%20Review%20-%209.03.2024.pdf\" title=\"Design Thinking Lit Review\">Design Thinking</a></li>\r\n\t\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/RREV%20-%20Extended%20Learning%20Opportunities%20-%209.03.2024.pdf\" title=\"ELO Lit Review\">Extended Learning Opportunities</a></li>\r\n\t\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/RREV%20-%20Multiple%20Pathways%20-%209.03.2024.pdf\" title=\"Multiple Pathways Lit Review\">Multiple Pathways</a></li>\r\n\t\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/RREV%20-%20Continuous%20Improvement%20Lit%20Review%20-%209.03.2024.pdf\" title=\"Continuous Improvement Lit Review\">Continuous Improvement</a></li>\r\n\t</ol>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/RREV%20-%20Pilot%20Model%20Template%20-%209.17.2024.pdf\">IMPD Pilot Template</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/RREV%20-%20Logic%20Model%20R1CC%20RREV%20Template%20-%209.03.2024.pdf\" title=\"Logic Model Template\">Logic Model Template</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/RREV%20-%20Coaching%20Framework%20-%209.17.2024.pdf\">Coaching Framework</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/RREV%20-%20Innovation%20Coaches%20Journey%20Map%20-%209.27.2024.pdf\" title=\"RREV Coaches Journey Map\">Coaches Journey Map</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/RREV%20-%20Culture%20of%20Innovation%20-%209.03.2024.pdf\" title=\"Culture of Innovation\">Culture of Innovation</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/RREV%20-%20Scaling%20Innovation-Self%20Reflection%20-%209.27.2024.pdf\" title=\"RREV Sustainability Self-Reflection\">Sustainability Self-Reflection</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/RREV%20-%20Creating%20Conditions%20to%20Support%20Innovation%20-%209.27.2024.pdf\" title=\"RREV Creating Conditions to Support Innovation\">Creating Conditions to Support Innovation</a></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-8\">\r\n<div class=\"card\"><img alt=\"Card image cap\" class=\"card-img-top\" src=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-images/RREV%20RD%20-%20Research%20-%20Modules.png\" width=\"100%\" />\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<h3 class=\"card-title\">Comp Center IMPD Module Series</h3>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action\">Module 1 Video - <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CPRsjztwld8&amp;list=PL-cO8lcaOYu3LpJBpBbOPpX64LBvO1F7t&amp;index=40\" target=\"_blank\">Introduction to the Module Series</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">Video</span></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action\">Module 2 Video - <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=S0qWs1PoyTI&amp;list=PL-cO8lcaOYu3LpJBpBbOPpX64LBvO1F7t&amp;index=41&amp;t=1s\" target=\"_blank\">Using Data to Define the Need</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">Video</span></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action\">Module 2 <a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/RREV%20-%20Companion%20Guide%20Mod%202%20-%209.03.2024.pdf\" title=\"RREV - Companion Guide Mod 2\">Companion Guide</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action\